          "id": "world-saudi-houthi-missiles-2026-11-08",
          "headline": "Saudi-led coalition says it shot down three Houthi missiles fired at Riyadh and east",
          "summary": "The Saudi-led coalition says its air defences destroyed three ballistic missiles fired from Yemen on Sunday, two aimed at Riyadh and one at the oil-rich Eastern province. The Houthis say they targeted Aramco facilities and Riyadh airport, and that coalition strikes killed 33 people near Sanaa. No damage to oil sites has been reported.",
